# 1. API List – User Synchronization

The following API list covers individual user registration, bulk registration, node synchronization, monitoring and retry mechanisms.

## A. User Registration APIs


| POST | `/api/users/bulk` | Add multiple users in one transaction and initiate synchronization after successful commit |

## B. Node Synchronization APIs

These APIs are implemented in the receiving services running on individual Macro Nodes.

| Method | API | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/internal/sync/users/batch` | Receive and process user synchronization batch |
| GET | `/api/internal/sync/status/{batchId}` | Get processing status of a received batch |
| GET | `/api/internal/sync/health` | Check Macro Node connectivity and availability |
| GET | `/api/internal/sync/checkpoint` | Retrieve last successfully processed synchronization checkpoint |

## C. Synchronization Monitoring APIs

These APIs are implemented in the central User Management application.

| Method | API | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/sync/batches` | List all synchronization batches |
| GET | `/api/sync/batches/{batchId}` | Get synchronization batch details |
